%%{init: {'themeVariables': {'fontFamily': 'Noto Sans SC, Microsoft YaHei, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, SimHei, Arial, sans-serif'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as RouteDialog/RouteActionMenu
    participant APP as App Handler
    participant API as ApiService
    participant R as Orders/Routes Router
    participant SVC as BloombergEMSXService
    participant EMSX as Bloomberg EMSX

    Note over U,EMSX: T0 用户发起路由或路由变更

    U->>UI: 提交路由参数(券商/数量/价格/策略)
    activate UI

    alt 参数/权限不满足
        UI-->>U: 阻断并提示(状态/交易员/数量限制)
    else 通过校验
        UI->>APP: onRouteOrder / onModifyRoute / onCancelRoute
        activate APP

        alt 新建路由
            APP->>API: routeOrder()
            activate API
            API->>R: POST /api/orders/route
        else 修改路由
            APP->>API: modifyRoute()
            activate API
            API->>R: POST /api/routes/modify
        else 取消路由
            APP->>API: cancelRoute()
            activate API
            API->>R: POST /api/routes/cancel
        end

        activate R
        R->>SVC: route_order / modify_route / cancel_route
        activate SVC

        alt route_order
            SVC->>SVC: 校验 parent 状态/remaining/trader
            SVC->>EMSX: RouteEx(+策略参数)
        else modify_route
            SVC->>EMSX: ModifyRouteEx
        else cancel_route
            SVC->>EMSX: CancelRouteEx
        end
        activate EMSX
        EMSX-->>SVC: 执行结果
        deactivate EMSX

        SVC-->>R: success/error
        R-->>API: ApiResponse
        API-->>APP: result
        APP-->>UI: toast + onRefresh

        Note over APP: T1 统一刷新订单+路由
        APP->>API: fetchOrders()
        API->>R: GET /api/orders + /api/routes
        R-->>API: refreshed
        API-->>APP: refreshed

        deactivate SVC
        deactivate R
        deactivate API
        deactivate APP
    end

    deactivate UI
    Note over U,EMSX: T2 路由状态回显完成